{"data":{"body":"[P2] Flush exporters concurrently as well as exporting concurrently. This method flushes them sequentially, so a slow or stuck first buffered exporter prevents every later exporter from flushing before Lambda freezes or times out, despite their records having exported successfully. Fan out each `flush()` on isolated scheduler workers, await all settled tasks, and add a test where one flush blocks while another completes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7tZ6LJ","finding_digest":"8c0117e815f3758d1b73a8fe22f48ab2126fd85b102f10fffcf5b6177308dd5c","finding_id":"arf_v1_rqarp2av6n2y2g3tvd7cf5ekwi","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::drainandflush::flush-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::drainandflush::flush-isolation","line":232,"observation_digest":"3821571c991f1ee0ab83b2ac08cd2af3185270cfd3fb4357bf116520366fe4cf","observation_id":"aro_v1_haqvohezd4pobk4dwkwartjk6m","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T20:01:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_saa42mnn4lbejfqoxbjsi46fng","reviewed_base_sha":"8505ec435fef4fae896ea5c3136272258a94ed25","reviewed_head_sha":"bad83f960de5be6acea391b0b2be4f5487e365d8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":232,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":703},"record_id":"art_v1_awjqjyl32n237k46och27gtjfn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T20:01:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
